<p>Alweda moula hussain alweda moula<br />
Hogaya veeraan phir aaj ghar mera</p>

<p>Dil kholkar hussain ka matam na kar sake<br />
Matami rote hain sab hai yahi sada</p>

<p>1. Us gham naseeb bano e muztar ko royiye&rsquo;<br />
Jhoole ko dekh dekh ke asghar ko royiye<br />
Jhoolna asghar ka wo yaad ayega</p>

<p>2. Agha kaha hussain ko bhai bhi bolte<br />
Khawish hai aakhri meti bhai kaho mujhe<br />
Aur phir abbas ne bhai kehdiya</p>

<p>3. Apne watan se aaj liye sab ke dil ka chain<br />
Sar pa udhao khaak ke jaate hain ab hussain<br />
Ahle haram ke sath hai ashkoun ka qafela</p>

<p>4. Choudha(14) sau saal baad bhi aankho&rsquo;n me hai name<br />
Zehra ki ye dua hai rahe shaad matami<br />
Nasiraane shah ka hai martaba mila</p>

<p>5. Dawar malak se bolenge turbat me matami<br />
You&rsquo;n gham kiya hussain ka fursat nahi mili<br />
rate rahe hussain ko kab hamne ye kaha</p>

